<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-epitaph-cuihong" book-id="b-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts" chapter-id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts" source-id="s-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts-rubbing">
  <p id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p000" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">君諱<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p000:m0002" ref="30f_353_0e8">鴻</persName>，字<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p000:m0005" ref="30f_353_0e8">彥鸞</persName>，齊州清河人也。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">不幸遘疾，春秋卌有八，粵孝昌元年十一月壬辰朔廿九日庚午薨於洛陽仁信里。窀窆於黄山之陰。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">君次弟<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0003" ref="u3z_kcn_2cf_B">鷫</persName>，輕車將軍太尉記室。君第四弟<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0018" ref="u3z_kcn_2cf_A">鵾</persName>，奉朝請。君妻清河<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0028" ref="vfh_ufx_cdv">張慶之</persName>女。父州主簿別駕齊郡太守。君長息<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0047" ref="ih5_w5y_2s0">子元</persName>，為齊州主簿。次息<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0058" ref="30f_353_0e8_A">子文</persName>。次息<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0063" ref="30f_353_0e8_B">子真</persName>。次息<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0068" ref="30f_353_0e8_C">子長</persName>。次息<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0073" ref="30f_353_0e8_D">子發</persName>。次息<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0078" ref="30f_353_0e8_E">子房</persName>。君長女<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0084" ref="30f_353_0e8_F">元華</persName>，適河東<persName id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0090" ref="fw6_hvj_q1e">裴藹之</persName>。之為員外散騎侍郎。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">孝昌二年歲次丙午九月丁酉朔十七日癸丑造。</p>
</text>
